                    <p class="relative mb-1/25em text-18 leading-1/6em qc-text-justify">QC Legal is a specialist legal recruitment agency with over two decades of experience connecting outstanding lawyers and legal professionals with top-tier law firms and in-house legal teams across the UK, Europe, the Middle East and other key international markets.</p>
                    <p class="relative mb-1/25em text-18 leading-1/6em qc-text-justify">We focus on sourcing and securing high-calibre legal talent across a wide range of practice areas. From newly qualified solicitors to partners, legal directors, general counsel and full team moves, we help firms build agile, high-performing, multi-disciplinary legal teams that are best in class. We also support complex senior-level lateral moves, aligning recruitment with your long-term strategic goals.</p>
                    <p class="relative mb-1/25em text-18 leading-1/6em qc-text-justify">Our re-engineered legal recruitment model combines deep sector knowledge with a collaborative and consultative approach. We work closely with Managing Partners, Heads of Legal HR teams and senior leadership to deliver tailored solutions built on market insight precision and long-term value. With a global reach and unrivalled network we consistently match exceptional legal talent with leading solicitor vacancies achieving successful outcomes for both clients and candidates.</p>
